record.dic_text:
0388 'Eythaniym {e:-ta:-ni:m'}

0386 的複數型; 陽性專有名詞 月份名稱

欽定本 - Ethanim 1; 1

以他念 = "永久的"
1) 猶太曆法的第七個月, 相當於現行西曆的十至十一月;
   因溪水恆常流動而如此命名 (#王上 8:2|)

record.edic_text:
0388 'Eythaniym {ay-thaw-neem'}

plural of 0386;; n pr m

AV - Ethanim 1; 1

Ethanim = "enduring"
1) seventh Jewish month, corresponding to modern Oct. to Nov.;
   so named because permanent streams still flowed
